.TH batten-state-adopt 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-state\-adopt \- Bind this checkout to its findings store, minting one only if none exists
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten state adopt\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIstore\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bind this checkout to its findings store, minting one only if none exists
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIstore\fR]
The store id to bind, when resolution cannot decide for itself
